## Direct-only Server (no network object): see docs/guide/configuration.md.
## Forward accepted client streams only to this loopback TCP service.
target: 127.0.0.1:8080
## Direct QUIC endpoint; port 0 lets the OS choose.
bind: 0.0.0.0:0
## Paths are relative to the process working directory, not to this file.
key_file:: server.key
allowlist_path:: allowed.txt
fallback: signal
